      m_Calls: []
  m_text: " - Use Spacebar to Jump.\n - Tap the spacebar for shrot jumps and long
    presss it for higher jumps\n\nIf you finished a level make sure to hit the next
    button to save your progress, this is a slight bug that will be fixed after the
    GMTK game jam review process. Other improvement and extra levels will also be
    made after.\n\nThis game was made under 96 hours.\n\nGoodluck, cause you'll need
    it."
